  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoon butter",
    "1/4 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened shredded coconut",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 large egg yolk",
    "1/4 cup coconut flour",
    "1/2 cup water",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/4 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "2 tablespoon unsweetened shredded coconut",
    "1/3 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 tablespoon stevia/erythritol blend"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a pot, melt the butter on medium-low.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in the sugar substitute, while stirring, until it has dissolved into the butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in the almond flour and coconut flakes until the mixture clumps together easily.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the crust into the bottom of a ramekin and flatten using a spoon.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let it cool while you make the custard",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a pot (I used the same pot as the crust), heat up the cream for custard on medium-low.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Separate the eggs and place the yolks into a bowl. It’s time to make the slurry!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the coconut flour, followed by the water. You should have a thick, coconut & egg mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the vanilla to the cream on the stove and stir.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour or spoon the slurry into the cream, as well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-13-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a whisk, stir often until the mixture thickens.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let it cool for about 5 minutes before spooning the custard into the ramekins on top of the crust. Let it set it the fridge for at least an hour.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small pan heat up the coconut flakes on low, stirring often. They will start to toast and are ready when they are a nice golden brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-17.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, stir together the remaining topping ingredients. Using a hand or stand mixer, beat the cream until it forms stiff peaks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/individual-coconut-cream-pies-19.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When ready to serve the custard, spoon the cream on top of the custard and sprinkle the toasted coconut on top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-coconut-cream-pies/#wprm-recipe-52341-step-0-14",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
